  "notes": "Children enter Tahun 1 in the year they are 6 on 1 January. Form 6 is post-secondary in MOE's terms and lasts 1.5 years (three semesters, leading to STPM); it is listed as one level after Form 5. Others leave after Form 5 (SPM) for matriculation or other routes. Pupils from Chinese/Tamil-medium primary schools may take a Remove (Peralihan) year before Form 1. English names are the usual renderings of the Malay ones."
